{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts","id":1519425,"title":"W5 release thoughts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-02T07:33:33-07:00","id":1519425,"title":"W5 release thoughts","content":"So, from a quick glance, here are some that stood out;<br /> <br /> -We were right, Fenrir did in fact declare Apocalypse and are fighting against the Wyrm.<br /> -You can redeems BSDs but Fenrir seem more vague.<br /> -They kept the Do not Eat Human Flesh tenet and one Red Talon archetype is LITERALLY a man eater.<br /> -Litany is exactly the same and yet there is a section decrying its evils.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":110,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","user":"Ana Mizuki","date":". 08-02-2023, 10:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T08:06:54-07:00","id":1519427,"title":"","content":"I probably will have more thoughts later in the week (I'm battling a cold right now... -.- ) but one question I immediately had while skimming the book: The contrast (or more like the lack thereof) between Red Talons and the Cult of Fenris. The way the Red Talons are described would make me think that they would happily join up with the Cult of Fenris. But somehow the Red Talons get this apologetic, forgiving attitude in their section while the Fenrir are these absolute monsters... for kinda having the same attitude as Red Talons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":17}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T08:10:40-07:00","id":1519428,"title":"","content":"Wait, I thought the Litany was meant to be being trimmed to allow hot werewolf on werewolf action? I'm also seeing we're now in the era where people can't be trusted to deduce that the obstructive code of conduct literally designed to keep elders in power is a bad thing.<br /> <br /> What's the credits like? I'm mostly interested if any of the Hunters Entertainment writers or tracing models got their duly deserved credit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T08:29:43-07:00","id":1519431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwoDSix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts?p=1519428#post1519428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, I thought the Litany was meant to be being trimmed to allow hot werewolf on werewolf action? I'm also seeing we're now in the era where people can't be trusted to deduce that the obstructive code of conduct literally designed to keep elders in power is a bad thing.<br /> <br /> What's the credits like? I'm mostly interested if any of the Hunters Entertainment writers or tracing models got their duly deserved credit.</div> </div> </div> </div>THAT part is removed, but the rest are still there.<br /> <br /> No credits as far as I can see.<br /> <br /> Silver Fangs are basically unchanged minus the PB requirement, so add that to the 'like Fenrir but not' pile.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T08:34:02-07:00","id":1519433,"title":"","content":"Why do W5's writers have such a hateboner for the Get of Fenris? I mean, fucking Black Spiral Dancers can be saved but not the Fenrir?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T08:42:53-07:00","id":1519434,"title":"","content":"Looked through some archetypes to see what is expected. These are the ones that really make me ponder;<br /> <br /> -A leader of a small Eastern European Country that has plenty of xenophobia (Shadow Lord)<br /> - A wolf that spreads disease where it goes (Red Talon)<br /> - A person who eats humans (Red Talon)<br /> - A drug dealer (Child of Gaia)<br /> - A drugged-out rich person seeking the next high (Silver Fang)<br /> - A former American Football star?? (Silver Fang)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T08:44:38-07:00","id":1519436,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts?p=1519434#post1519434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looked through some archetypes to see what is expected. These are the ones that really make me ponder;<br /> <br /> -A leader of a small Eastern European Country that has plenty of xenophobia (Shadow Lord)<br /> - A wolf that spreads disease where it goes (Red Talon)<br /> - A person who eats humans (Red Talon)<br /> - A drug dealer (Child of Gaia)<br /> - A drugged-out rich person seeking the next high (Silver Fang)<br /> - A former American Football star?? (Silver Fang)</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait what?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T08:52:17-07:00","id":1519438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts#post1519425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, from a quick glance, here are some that stood out;...<br /> <br /> <br /> -They kept the Do not Eat Human Flesh tenet and one Red Talon archetype is LITERALLY a man eater.<br /> -Litany is exactly the same and yet there is a section decrying its evils.</div> </div> </div> </div>As far as I know, there's this story that the Red Talons consume human flesh and have rituals to purify and hide the traces of the act, so I don't think it's that strange.<br /> <br /> Now I'm confused, didn't they remove the metis in this version? So what happens if two Garou breed? Is there no way to get pregnant or is the child born normal with no chance of becoming a Garou? That got a little confusing. And what evils are these they mention? Are they the ones we already know, or did they add more?\u200b<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T08:55:19-07:00","id":1519439,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts?p=1519431#post1519431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">THAT part is removed, but the rest are still there.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, so they only removed the parts players are most likely to fight against anyway?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> No credits as far as I can see. </div> </div> </div>I guess it's to be expected, seeing as nobody from Paradox or Renegade stated that tracing models/sources would be credited. Massive kick in the teeth for anybody who's had their work or likeness used, but why would that matter to Paradox? I'm sure for them this is a second tier VtM expansioon.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Silver Fangs are basically unchanged minus the PB requirement, so add that to the 'like Fenrir but not' pile. </div> </div> </div>Is Pure Breed even a thing in W5? Considering Garou are supposed to pop out of humanity at random it would be straight up weird.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt Corleone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts?p=1519433#post1519433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why do W5's writers have such a hateboner for the Get of Fenris? I mean, fucking Black Spiral Dancers can be saved but not the Fenrir?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because Swords of Heimdall. Although from what I hear W5 Get might be more Mjolnir's Thunder.<br /> <br /> If I was being generous I'd guess they were making a point about 'forced into evil' versus 'chose to be evil', but i really don't think the developers though beyond 'Nazi werewolves, alt right bad, no redeeming rage monster alt righters'.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T09:00:20-07:00","id":1519441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts?p=1519438#post1519438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As far as I know, there's this story that the Red Talons consume human flesh and have rituals to purify and hide the traces of the act, so I don't think it's that strange.<br /> <br /> Now I'm confused, didn't they remove the metis in this version? So what happens if two Garou breed? Is there no way to get pregnant or is the child born normal with no chance of becoming a Garou? That got a little confusing. And what evils are these they mention? Are they the ones we already know, or did they add more?\u200b<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, there is that Rite. But the whole point of it is that Red Talons do it in secret and lie as well as they can to hide it. The Maneater's text doesn't hint that they hide what they do.<br /> <br /> Yes, garou can (as far as I know) produce fertile offspring with each other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T09:06:42-07:00","id":1519442,"title":"","content":"My only thought so far is that Cult of Fenris is right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27335-technoma","name":"Technoma","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T09:28:37-07:00","id":1519448,"title":"","content":"Someone wanted to see the credits:<br /> <br /> <img width=\"742\" height=\"1001\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bXkcEB1.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/bXkcEB1.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/bXkcEB1.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai",