now, plus as american football is a violent sport he's used to it throwing punches, that being said what in theory would be a good candidate for Silver Fangs;\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T09:41:40-07:00","id":1519451,"title":"","content":"<img width=\"328\" height=\"129\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qk7ylgf.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qk7ylgf.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/Qk7ylgf.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> ... Whaaaaaaa?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T09:42:22-07:00","id":1519452,"title":"","content":"Urgh, had a post deleted as spam.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts?p=1519448#post1519448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone wanted to see the credits:<br /> <br /> <img width=\"742\" height=\"1001\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bXkcEB1.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/bXkcEB1.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/bXkcEB1.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting, not surprising, and disappointing. They probably could have got a lot more goodwill if it had turned out they'd been planning on giving due credit all along, if anything I suspect this'll only deepen the issues people have with the art if/when more tracing is uncovered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T09:44:36-07:00","id":1519453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519425-w5-release-thoughts?p=1519450#post1519450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In the order:<br /> <br /> -It seems plausible, xenophobia, as bad as it is, can be used as a control tool or he can try to change it by manipulating the scenery through the shadows in any way that matches the SL's MO;<br /> -What is his purpose?<br /> -I don't know if I understood, it's a homid that wants to become a Red Talon and that's a kind of strange initiation rite?<br /> -Strangely this makes sense;<br /> -They took the pampered royal business to another level;<br /> -What's weird? If he's a captain or a prominent member, you can tell he's a leader and he's used to working on a team, it's just a different team now, plus as american football is a violent sport he's used to it throwing punches, that being said what in theory would be a good candidate for Silver Fangs;\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>-This is the type of character the game is geared towards treating as an antagonist. Plus integrating this character to a game is going to be near impossible.<br /> -THeir purpose is to spread disease and kill humans that way.<br /> - Its a Red Talon that openly eats hunters and gathers with other similar cannibal garou.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T09:49:26-07:00","id":1519454,"title":"","content":"Man, that system for Rites they have in W5 seems very punitive. Also, as we discussed during the previews, it doesn't support the communal aspect of Garou very well.<br /> <br /> This is how Rites work:<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <ul><li>A Rite must be led by a Rite master, who must know the Rite</li> <li>Each participant, including the Rite master, must have at least one point of Rage</li> <li>The die pool traits are noted in the Rite and are those of the Rite master</li> <li>Each other participant contributes one Rage die</li> <li>Each other participant who knows the Rite contributes one regular die, as well</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div>So you have the Ritemaster with a dice-pool like &quot;Honor + Occult&quot; and the Difficulty is usually &quot;Diff = number of participants (minimum is 3, though)&quot;. But mind you having a 1 or 2 on at least two Rage-Dice causes a Brutal Outcome and the Rites each have an additional effect when you have a Brutal Outcome (usually it's a bad one like WP-damage).<br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-02T09:51:24-07:00","id":1519455,"title":"","content":"Animal magnetism is a icky rape power, we're not having anything lik